<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile offers 7,500 tons of zinc on Feb 18.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile offers 7,500 tons of zinc on Feb 18.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said on Friday it will issue a new zinc solicitation on Feb 18 to sell a maximum of 7,500 short tons of zinc, the most allowed in any given month.</p>
<p>The Stockpile noted there are 17,615 short tons of zinc left for sale in the current fiscal year which ends September 30, out of the 50,000 short tons that was authorised.</p>
<p>((New York Commodities 212-859-1646))</p>
